msgid "BotBlox DroneNet"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:11
#: 915ff01fb6fc40bb938c615622813268
msgid "The `BotBlox DroneNet <https://botblox.io/dronenet-for-ardupilot/>`__ ethernet adapter allows STM32 H7 autopilots without built-in ethernet support to connect to ethernet peripherals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:14
#: c44e004c043749b18cfcafb8d9410656
msgid "Where To Buy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:16
#: e5294bb044c443ad9cf6e381f73507e7
msgid "The `BotBlox DroneNet can be purchased directly from BotBlox <https://botblox.io/dronenet-for-ardupilot/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:18
#: 169494016469471a87725b877f6d449f
msgid "Optionally the `SwitchBlox Cable Adapter <https://botblox.io/switchblox-cable-adapter-for-ardupilot/>`__ may be useful to ease the ethernet port differences across device manufacturers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:21
#: b49f92ebba7e45a9aac74846999d1dbb
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:27
#: fa8cd145d9cc4d239ef69b1ee32dea93
msgid "Connect one of the autopilot's serial ports to the DroneNet's UART port. For optimum performance the autopilot's serial port should support flow control which normally means using Serial1 or Serial2.  In the image above Serial2 is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:29
#: ba01da9bb3ad49acaa0dee3228eb3bbd
msgid "Connect one of the autopilot's CAN ports to the DroneNet's CAN port.  This connection is only used to configure the DroneNet device and so it maybe removed after the configuration is completed.  In the image above the autopilot's CAN1 is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:31
#: 58d9179707cf4cbc826886caad258897
msgid "5V Power can be provided through the dedicated power port or through the Serial or CAN port"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:34
#: f3e280ef605548afb9adf7c79345246f
msgid "Install ArduPilot with PPP Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:36
#: 7fd0d20406b94b9d87fe16c645924444
msgid "`PPP <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point-to-Point_Protocol_over_Ethernet>`__ allows an autopilot to communicate over Ethernet using a serial port but with the exception of the CubePilot CubeOrangePlus, PPP is not included by default in the ArduPilot firmware."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:38
#: b22a849be83e41359d407c854f9fbdad
msgid "Use the `Custom Firmware Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ to build a firmware that includes PPP support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:43
#: ae23274edb1447dba1fe9bdec08fe2f9
msgid "Alternatively :ref:`build the code yourself <building-the-code>` and enable PPP by adding ``--enable-PPP`` to the waf configuration step"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:44
#: 8ab216483c454e5093d48ffebdc55924
msgid ":ref:`Install the firmware on the autopilot <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:47
#: 66b683570684428f9e9889a5fdf43cc9
msgid "Autopilot Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:49
#: d6bfc479f51c491db6f71a8ba2f75133
msgid "See the ``PPP configuration`` and ``ArduPilot Port Configuration`` sections of :ref:`common-network` but in short set these parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:51
#: e050f875a7394651895795e6b6139a2d
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:52
#: d1b0b04eddeb491c876c8d43429eb7db
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:53
#: 0c8d9ad33c3845f2a8df9320a023a4e6
msgid ":ref:`NET_ENABLE <NET_ENABLE>` = 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:54
#: e72e25796f3a4303bbb5adf47f2a2af7
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 48 (PPP)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:55
#: 1b1cf583fa364a76b5dbad0c5eb4d090
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 12500000 (12.5MBaud)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:57
#: d2982c3017bf4d33aee8df46fc69f6b5
msgid "To allow the autopilot to eventually communicate with other ethernet devices, the :ref:`NET_P1_TYPE <NET_P1_TYPE>`, :ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL <NET_P1_PROTOCOL>`, etc parameters will need to be set. More details on the settings required can be found in the \"Ethernet Connectivity\" sections of the ArduPilot wiki page for the device.  For example :ref:`Siyi camera setups can be found on this page <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`"
msgstr ""

